      "statement": "On EventMsg the app sets store.Live, applies the event to the display store, and marks the session dirty so the transcript re-renders once per applied event (coalesced, not per frame); on resyncMsg it re-hydrates the current route over REST and re-arms the resync pump while the footer shows the outage window.",
