    {
      "id": "claim_3c9061f3571942d99fb5a1e381ad92c3",
      "statement": "The log package is a local-only, zero-telemetry, slog-based leveled file logger on a rotating append-only file at <dataDir>/log/yolo.log: 5 MiB rotation threshold to a single-generation .1 backup, YOLO_LOG_LEVEL (invalid falls back to INFO), opt-in YOLO_PRINT_LOGS=1 stderr mirror, and best-effort semantics (open/write failures never propagate; a nil Logger no-ops and each write retries the open).",
